    marker fraction per rectangle: 5-25% of rectangle area
    total markers across all rectangles: 13-25 [observed]
  selection_rule:
    exactly one rectangle has strictly the most marker pixels (unique winner)
    output = exact bounding-box crop of that rectangle (no recoloring)

